# Twilight of the Union: multiplayer frontend windows in the broadcast style (full copy of vanilla 1.19.3
# interface/frontendmultiplayerview.gui; every vanilla element name and type is kept).
#   frontendmultiplayerview   no background; drawn over matchmaking_window (same 1022x560 rect, see matchmaking.gui):
#                             player name field in the filter band, version in the title row, "Server ID" plate in
#                             the plate row next to Back
#   multiplayer_host_window   board 500x428: title, four labelled fields, visibility checkboxes, Back / Host
#   multiplayer_info_window   board 480x200: message (totu_body), Back
#   multiplayer_connect_window board 500x240: title, address / password fields, Back / Join
